<title>UK: Thistle Hotels sets 60 mln stg debenture stock.</title>
<headline>Thistle Hotels sets 60 mln stg debenture stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debenture stock issue was announced by lead manager NatWest Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THISTLE HOTELS PLC</p>
<p> AMT    60 MLN STG    COUPON     7.875     MATURITY	   2022</p>
<p> TYPE   DEBENTURE     ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S 26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     SPREAD     +80 BP    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> DENOMS     ONE	 PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN  LISTING     LONDON</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2021 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
